  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1-preview.26\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.26 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.25\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.25 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.24\n- Renamed the shipped JavaScript module to fireForNet-installations-indexeddb-shared.js, matching the module name the Blazor package binds it to.\n- The module ships from a physical copy in this package's own wwwroot, instead of a link into the Blazor package. A linked copy resolved its content root to the linking project and 404ed at runtime.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.23\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.23 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.22\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.22 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.21\n- No functional changes; synchronized with the framework-free MAUI integration sweep.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.20\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.20 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.19\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.19 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.18\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.18 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.17\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.17 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.16\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.16 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.15\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.15 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.14\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.14 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.13\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.13 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.1\n- Initial release.\n- [JSImport]-based IndexedDB and localStorage persistence for InstallationEntry.\n- Framework-independent WASM (Uno Platform, Avalonia WASM, pure .NET WASM).\n- IndexedDB-primary store with localStorage fallback when IndexedDB is unavailable or security-blocked.",
